ownership-certificate-v2
class drop Drop
class iconst Constant
class list_new Fresh
class list_view_of View
class record_make Construct
class record_take Take
function bad_take_holds_view result scalar from - unchecked -
inst %9 iconst Constant reads - consumes - state scalar parents -
block b0 preds -
inst %0 list_new Fresh reads - consumes - state owned parents -
inst %1 list_view_of View reads %0 consumes - state borrowed parents %0
inst %2 record_make Construct reads %1 consumes - state owned parents %1 views %1
inst %3 record_take Take reads - consumes %2 state owned parents -
inst - drop Drop reads - consumes %0 state none parents -
inst - drop Drop reads - consumes %3 state none parents -
term ret -
end
